  The live Sparkle feed, served by GitHub Pages from this folder at
  https://thienanblog.github.io/geda-clipboard/appcast.xml

  Generated, not hand-edited. After publishing a release, download its macOS
  archive into an otherwise empty folder and run generate_appcast over that
  folder, writing here. See scripts/README for the exact invocation: the flags
  it needs are spelled with double hyphens, and XML forbids those inside a
  comment, so this file cannot quote the command it was made by.

  generate_appcast reads the version and the minimum system version out of the
  bundle, and signs the enclosure with the EdDSA key in the login keychain.
  length and edSignature describe one exact file; a value that is merely close
  makes Sparkle reject the update and blame the download.

  The archives stay on Releases, where each URL names the version it belongs
  to. Only this file lives on Pages, because a feed has to keep one address
  across every release.
-->
